# A filtered list follows the same cursors.
> ITEM LIST CAT=CARD PAGE=6 FIELDS=ITEM_ID,CATEGORY
< +DATA
< F ITEM_ID CATEGORY
< R 2 CARD
< R 4 CARD
< R 6 CARD
< R 8 CARD
< R 10 CARD
< R 12 CARD
< C ITEMS1:2020202020203132:C
< .
