< R 16 CARD
< R 18 CARD
< R 20 CARD
< R 22 CARD
< R 24 CARD
< C ITEMS1:2020202020203234:18
< .
> ITEM LIST CAT=CARD PAGE=6 FIELDS=ITEM_ID,CATEGORY AFTER=ITEMS1:2020202020203234:18
< +DATA
< F ITEM_ID CATEGORY
< R 26 CARD
< R 28 CARD
< R 30 CARD
< .
> ITEM LIST STATUS=D
< +DATA
< F ITEM_ID CATEGORY MFR MODEL WORKS QTY AVAIL LOC_ID LOC_NAME STATUS
< .

